    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoashi omorwoti bw’Abayuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Abar 12:1-6)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoashi agachaaka kogamba ekero arenge nemiaka etano na ebere, na akagamba emiaka emerongo ene agwo Yerusalemu. Ng’ina nigo arenge korokwa Sibia korwa Beeri‐Seba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoashi agakora ayare amaronge ase amaiso ’Omonene ase amatuko onsi Yehoyada Omokuani arenge moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyada akamonyuomeria abakungu babere, na barabwo bakamoiborera abana, abamura na abaiseke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ayio Yoashi akagania koroisia enyomba y’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agasangereria abakuani na Abalawi, akabateebia, “Kera omwaka, genda ase emechie y’Abayuda, mosangererie chitaabu korwa ase Abaisraeli bonsi, chibe ase okoroiseria enyomba ya Nyasae oino; mokore ayio ase obwango.” Korende Abalawi tibakorete ring’ana erio ase obwango.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti akarangeria Yehoyada, Omokuani oria bw’omonene, akamobooria, “Nase ki otarateebia Abalawi barente korwa ase Abayuda na abanto ba Yerusalemu ebango yachigetwe na Musa, omosomba bw’Omonene, eyio omosangererekano ogwenerete korenta ase Eema y’Oborori?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abana abamura b’Atalia, omokungu oria orenge gokora amabe amange, konya babochoire enyomba ya Nyasae basoire ime; boigo ebinto biatananeretwe ase enyomba y’Omonene, babibekire ase chinyasae chiria Baali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio buna omorwoti achigete, esanduki ekaroisigwa ekabekwa isiko ase egeita ki’enyomba y’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abayuda na abanto ba Yerusalemu bakaraarerigwa barente ase Omonene ebango eria Musa, omosomba o Nyasae, abeekerete Abaisraeli agwo ase erooro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abatang’ani b’abaanto, amo nabaanto bonsi, bakabeeka chitaabu chiabo ime ase esanduki eria bare nomogooko, goika ebango yonsi ekarentwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Engaki ende yonsi esanduki eria yare korentwa n’Abalawi ase abanto baria omorwoti achorete, na ekero barabwo baare korora ng’a chitaabu chiabeire chinyinge, omoriki bw’omorwoti na omosomba bw’Omokuani bw’omonene nigo baare gocha barusia chitaabu echio. Magega y’ayio bairania esanduki eria aase aye. Bakaba bagokora igo rituko ase rituko bagasangereria chitaabu chinyinge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti na Yehoyada bakaa abatenenerete emeremo y’enyomba y’Omonene chitaabu chiria, na abwo bakarika abaagacheri amagena na abasenia be chibao baroiserie enyomba y’Omonene ase yatagogete; boigo bakarika abakori emeremo b’ebioma na ab’etai baroisie enyomba eyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baria babegetwe gokora emeremo, bagakora omokia, na emeremo ekagenderera buya goika enyomba eria ekaroisigwa, ekaba buna enyia, naende enkong’u.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero emeremo eria yaerete chitaabu chiria chiatigarete chikarentwa ase omorwoti na Yehoyada. Korwa ase chitaabu echio chi’echifeta na echie chitaabu ebikorero bi’enyomba y’Omonene bikaroisigwa, ebitaabo na ebinto binde bigokorerwa ase omosangererekano, na ebi’ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa, na ebi’ogosambera ubani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Emeremo ya Yehoyada ekoonchoranwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abanto bakaba bakorua ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa ase enyomba y’Omonene kogenderera botambe ase obogima bwonsi bwa Yehoyada.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyada akaba omogotu mono, agakwa ekero akoorire emiaka rigana erimo, na emerongo etato.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto bakamotindeka agwo ase Omochie o Daudi, aase abarwoti barenge gotindekwa, ekiagera nigo akorete ayare amaya ase Abaisraeli, na ase Nyasae, na ase enyomba ya Nyasae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega Yehoyada g akuure, abanene b’Abayuda bakagenda ase omorwoti bakoorokia amasikani asare, na omorwoti akabategerera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto bagatiga enyomba y’Omonene, na Nyasae bwe chisokoro chiabo, bagakorera emete y’Asera, enyasae yabo enkungu, na emegwekano ende y’ogosasimwa. Ase ayio endamwamu y’Omonene egacha igoro ase Abayuda na abanto ba Yerusalemu ase engencho y’okomocha kwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende nonya naboigo, Omonene agatoma ababani ase egati yabo, erinde baabairanie asare; aba bakaba bakobakuurera korende abanto tibaabaigwerete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omoika o Nyasae ogaacha igoro ase Zakaria, mosinto o Yehoyada Omokuani. Ere agatenena ase egati y’abanto, akabateebia, “Aya naro Nyasae agokwana: Nase ki mogosaria amachiiko ’Omonene? Timokonyara gosesenigwa. Ekiagera inwe mwamotigire Omonene, nere obatigire inwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende bagakora omooroberio bw’okomoita, na ase ogochika kw’omorwoti bakamoaka amagena ase eraaro y’enyomba y’Omonene goika agakwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoashi omorwoti tainyorete obuya obo Yehoyada, ise Zakaria, konya amokoreire, korende agaita omwana oye. Ekero Zakaria arenge gokwa agateeba, “Tiga Omonene arore aya na arusie egesiomba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omoerio bw’okogamba kwa Yoashi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omoerio bw’omwaka abasikari b’Abasiiria bagacha korwania Yoashi. Bagacha ase Abayuda na ase abanto ba Yerusalemu, bagaita abanene bonsi b’abaanto abwo. Na ebisakorwa bionsi basakorete bakairera omorwoti o Damesiki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasiiria nigo bachete nabarwani abake mono, korende Omonene akabeeka abarwani abange mono ase amaboko abo, ekiagera Abayuda konya batigire Omonene, Nyasae bwe chisokoro chiabo. Igo Yoashi akaegwa egesusuro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasiiria bakagenda bagatiga Yoashi ore oakirwe chingoma chimbe. Korende abasomba baye bagakora omooroberio bw’okomoita, ekiagera aiterete amanyinga ’omwana o Yehoyada Omokuani; bakagenda bakamoitera borere bwaye, agakwa; na abanto bakamotindeka ase Omochie o Daudi, korende tibamotindegete ase chimbeera chi’abarwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamoitete nabwo aba: Sabadi, omomura o Simeati, omokungu bw’Abaamoni, na Yehosabadi, omomura o Simiriti, omokungu bw’Abamoabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amang’ana igoro y’abamura ba Yoashi na amang’ana akwanetwe igoro yaye, na buna aroisetie enyomba ya Nyasae, nigo ariikire ase Ogotebereria kw’Egetabu ki’Abarwoti. Amasia, omomura oye, akaba okogamba ase ribaga riaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
